04005006	“Tell the {Israelis} that when any man or a woman {disobeys God by doing any of the things that humans do} when they’re unfaithful towards Yahweh, then that person is guilty
04005007	and they must confess their {disobedience}. Then that person must make full reparation to whoever they wronged, along with an extra twenty percent {of the cost}.
04005008	{However,} if reparation to {the victim isn’t possible} {for some reason}, then it must be paid to Yahweh via a priest, in addition to the ram {that will be offered} for that person’s atonement.
