04005021	Then the priest will make the woman take that curse as an oath, and {he’ll} tell {her}, “Yahweh will {make your experience} a curse and your people {will see the results of the} oath, when Yahweh gives {disease to your genitals} and makes your belly swell.
04005022	This water will {invoke} the curse to make your belly swell and your {genitals shrivel}.” Then the woman must say, “Indeed, let it be so.”
