13001035	¶ Esau’s sons were Elifaz, Reuel, Yeush, Yalam, and Korah.
13001036	Elifaz’s sons were Teman, Omar, Tsefo, Gatam, Kenaz, Timna, and Amalek.
13001037	Reuel’s sons were Nahat, Zerah, Shammah, and Mizzah.
13001038	¶ Seir {was another descendant of Esau, and his} sons were Lotan, Shoval, Tsiveon, Anah, Dishon, Etser, and Dishan.
13001039	Lotan’s sons were Hori and Homam, and Lotan’s sister was Timna.
13001040	Shoval’s sons were Alyan, Manahat, Eyval, Shefo, and Onam. Tsiveon’s sons were Ayyah and Anah.
