13001052	Aholivamah, Elah, Pinon,
13001053	Kenaz, Teman, Mivtsar,
13001054	Magdiel, and Iram. Those were the chiefs of Edom.
13002001	¶ These were Yisrael’s sons: Reuven, Shimeon {(Simeon)}, Levi, and Yehudah {(Judah)}, Yissakar {(Issachar)}, and Zebulun,
13002002	Dan, Yosef {(Joseph)}, Benyamin, Naftali, Gad, and Asher.
13002003	¶ Yehudah’s sons (with the Canaanite woman Bat-Shua) were Er, and Onan, and Shelah. (Yehudah’s eldest son, Er, was evil in Yahweh’s eyes, and he killed him.)
