13002010	¶ Ram was the father of Amminadav, and Amminadav was the father of Nahshon—a leader of the {tribe} of Yehudah.
13002011	Nahshon was the father of Salma. Salma was the father of Boaz.
13002012	Boaz was the father of Oved. Oved was the father of Yishay {(Jesse)}.
