13003001	¶ These were David’s sons who were born to him in Hevron: the first was Amnon by Ahinoam the Yezreelite, the second Daniyel by Avigayil the Karmelite,
13003002	the third Avishalom {(Absalom)}, the son of Maakah (daughter of King Talmai of Geshur), the fourth Adoniyah, the son of Haggit,
13003003	the fifth Shefatyah by Avital, the sixth Yitream by his wife Eglah.
